        "id": 1986287
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-05T21:16:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oddly enough there is. At least, for one case: when the Watchdog (OG one, not Brad\u0027s new one) triggers and restarts the stack. See the implementation in https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/apps/Nfc/+/3323874",
      "parentUuid": "9b77deb0_955047dd",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1129,
        "startChar": 21,
        "endLine": 1129,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "273277c478bc3199f0ca5a3ce2d80c6379995418",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
