        "id": 1986287
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-05T21:16:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I agree it\u0027s not the clearest use case. I was expecting it to be used as a simple tally for metrics purposes. If a device is getting tons of command failed and NFC transactions aren\u0027t working (from Wallet\u0027s PoV), something NFC-related in probably broken. I noticed in our NFC metrics that we do see a lot of these errors, so it seemed important to surface.",
      "parentUuid": "0bd15801_0e0f4f81",
